  "content": "<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bebas+Neue&amp;family=Outfit:wght@300;400;600;700&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n:root {\n  --mg-red:     #c8352e;\n  --mg-dark:    #0a0a0a;\n  --mg-text:    #3a3a3a;\n  --mg-muted:   #71717a;\n  --mg-surface: #f5f5f3;\n  --mg-border:  #e4e4e7;\n}\n\n.title { display: none !important; }\n\n.sg {\n  font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;\n  font-weight: 300;\n  font-size: 1.05rem;\n  line-height: 1.8;\n  color: var(--mg-text);\n  max-width: 760px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n}\n\n.sg-h1 {\n  font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;\n  font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.2rem);\n  color: var(--mg-dark);\n  letter-spacing: 0.02em;\n  margin-bottom: 0.25rem;\n}\n\n.sg-h2 {\n  font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n  color: var(--mg-dark);\n  margin: 2.5rem 0 1rem;\n  border-bottom: 2px solid var(--mg-surface);\n  padding-bottom: 0.3rem;\n}\n\n.sg-fit-notice {\n  background: var(--mg-surface);\n  border: 1px solid var(--mg-border);\n  border-left: 4px solid var(--mg-red);\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  padding: 1.1rem 1.4rem;\n  margin: 1.5rem 0 2rem;\n  font-size: 0.95rem;\n}\n\n.sg-fit-notice strong {\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--mg-dark);\n}\n\n.sg-toggle {\n  display: flex;\n  background: var(--mg-surface);\n  border: 1px solid var(--mg-border);\n  border-radius: 50px;\n  padding: 4px;\n  width: fit-content;\n  margin: 0 0 2rem;\n  gap: 4px;\n}\n\n.sg-toggle-btn {\n  padding: 10px 28px;\n  border-radius: 50px;\n  border: none;\n  background: transparent;\n  font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  font-size: 0.85rem;\n  letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--mg-muted);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background 0.2s, color 0.2s;\n}\n\n.sg-toggle-btn.active {\n  background: var(--mg-dark);\n  color: #fff;\n}\n\n.sg-panel { display: none; }\n.sg-panel.active { display: block; }\n\n.sg-table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; margin: 0 0 2.5rem; }\n\n.sg-table {\n  width: 100%;\n  border-collapse: collapse;\n  font-size: 0.93rem;\n}\n\n.sg-table th {\n  font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  font-size: 0.7rem;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n  color: var(--mg-muted);\n  background: var(--mg-surface);\n  border-bottom: 2px solid var(--mg-border);\n  padding: 0.6rem 0.85rem;\n  text-align: left;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n\n.sg-table td {\n  padding: 0.6rem 0.85rem;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--mg-border);\n  color: var(--mg-text);\n}\n\n.sg-table tbody tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }\n\n.sg-table td:first-child {\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--mg-dark);\n}\n\n.sg-age {\n  font-size: 0.8rem;\n  color: var(--mg-muted);\n  font-weight: 400;\n}\n\n.sg-note {\n  font-size: 0.88rem;\n  color: var(--mg-muted);\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--mg-border);\n  padding-top: 1.25rem;\n  margin-top: 1rem;\n}\n\n.sg-note strong { color: var(--mg-dark); }\n.sg-note a { color: var(--mg-red); }\n\n@media (max-width: 600px) {\n  .sg-toggle { width: 100%; }\n  .sg-toggle-btn { flex: 1; text-align: center; padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 0.78rem; }\n  .sg-table th, .sg-table td { font-size: 0.8rem; padding: 0.5rem 0.6rem; }\n  .hide-sm { display: none; }\n}\n</style>\n<div class=\"sg\">\n<h1 class=\"sg-h1\">Gu&iacute;a de Tallas</h1>\n<div class=\"sg-fit-notice\"><strong>Nuestras camisetas tienen un corte atl&eacute;tico ajustado.</strong> Si est&aacute;s entre dos tallas o prefieres una mayor holgura en el campo, <strong>te recomendamos elegir la talla superior.</strong> Todas las medidas son corporales &mdash; no del tejido.</div>\n<div class=\"sg-toggle\" role=\"tablist\"><button class=\"sg-toggle-btn active\" data-panel=\"adult\" role=\"tab\">Adultos</button> <button class=\"sg-toggle-btn\" data-panel=\"kids\" role=\"tab\">Ni&ntilde;os / Juvenil</button></div>\n<!-- ── ADULTOS ── -->\n<div class=\"sg-panel active\" id=\"sg-adult\">\n<h2 class=\"sg-h2